---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout>
  <section class="home-hero site-shell">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">MAT / AGENT SYSTEMS</p>
      <h1>Less magic.<br /><span>More runtime.</span></h1>
      <p class="hero-description">我在做让 Agent 走出 Demo 后仍能可靠运行的工具：动作执行、状态恢复和质量验证。</p>
      <div class="hero-tags" aria-label="关注方向">
        <span>Agents</span><span>Tools</span><span>Evals</span><span>Recovery</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <img class="hero-avatar" src="/assets/images/mat-avatar.png" alt="Mat 的 M 标志" width="1254" height="1254" />
  </section>

  <section class="work-section site-shell" id="work" aria-labelledby="selected-work">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <h2 id="selected-work">Selected work</h2>
      <span>03 / OPEN SOURCE</span>
    </div>
    <div class="work-grid">
      <a class="work-card" href="https://github.com/mat973252/agent-permit4j" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
        <span class="work-number">01 / ACTION SAFETY</span>
        <h3>AgentPermit4j <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></h3>
        <p>让关键动作先经授权，再安全执行。</p>
        <span class="work-meta">Java · Policy · Approval</span>
      </a>
      <a class="work-card" href="https://github.com/mat973252/rag-contract4j" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
        <span class="work-number">02 / TESTING</span>
        <h3>RAGContract4j <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></h3>
        <p>把检索、权限与引用质量变成可重复的契约测试。</p>
        <span class="work-meta">RAG · Contracts · Evals</span>
      </a>
      <a class="work-card" href="https://github.com/mat973252/claude-recovery-hooks" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">
        <span class="work-number">03 / RECOVERY</span>
        <h3>Claude Recovery Hooks <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></h3>
        <p>在临时故障后，帮助 Claude Code 会话接着跑。</p>
        <span class="work-meta">PowerShell · Hooks · Recovery</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="post-section site-shell" id="notes" aria-labelledby="latest-posts">
    <div class="section-heading">
      <h2 id="latest-posts">Notes</h2>
      <span>01 / WRITING</span>
    </div>

    <a class="post-card" href="/posts/agent-anchor/">
      <div class="post-card-body">
        <div class="post-card-meta">2026-08-30 / AGENT ENGINEERING</div>
        <h3>Agent 时代下的锚点</h3>
        <p>从 Java 后端与企业知识检索实践出发，梳理 Agent 从 Demo 走向生产环境时不会轻易过时的八类工程能力。</p>
        <span class="read-more">阅读全文 <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></span>
      </div>
    </a>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
